301892950053#c6733394190506771272' title=''/><author><name>Tionico</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/04/war-is-holy-this-i-know-for-dear-leader.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2832267653747001452' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2832267653747001452' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1043294412"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 3, 2011 at 10:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6953712100143600580</id><published>2011-04-03T20:38:22.649-06:00</published><updated>2011-04-03T20:38:22.649-06:00</updated><title type='text'>You don&amp;#39;t understand Mr. Grigg. This isn&amp;#39;t...</title><content type='html'>You don&amp;#39;t understand Mr. Grigg. This isn&amp;#39;t a war - it&amp;#39;s just a kinetic military action. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;And a bank robbery is just a kinetic economic transaction.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Seriously, it is a delight to watch the hypocrisy derby as the &amp;quot;Bush&amp;#39;s wars bad/Obama&amp;#39;s wars good&amp;quot; lefties compete with the &amp;quot;Bush&amp;#39;s wars good/&lt;br /&gt;Obama&amp;#39;s wars bad&amp;quot; righties. The doublethink and doublespeak from both sides exposes the serious lack of intellectual integrity of either party.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2832267653747001452/comments/default/6953712100143600580'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2832267653747001452/comments/default/6953712100143600580'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/04/war-is-holy-this-i-know-for-dear-leader.html?showComment=1301884702649#c6953712100143600580' title=''/><author><name>whitebuffalo</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/03538355208030340243</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/04/war-is-holy-this-i-know-for-dear-leader.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2832267653747001452' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2832267653747001452' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-254268918"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="April 3, 2011 at 8:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5152316597218702037</id><published>2011-04-03T20:10:59.179-06:00</published><updated>2011-04-03T20:10:59.179-06:00</updated><title type='text'>So Caesar has not only crossed the Rubicon; but, n...</title><content type='html'>So Caesar has not only crossed the Rubicon; but, now has a four lane bridge for his convenience. No surprise, at least not anymore.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2832267653747001452/comments/default/5152316597218702037'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2832267653747001452/comments/default/5152316597218702037'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2011/04/war-is-holy-this-i-know-for-dear-leader.html?showComment=1301883059179#c5152316597218702037' title=''/><author><name>Retread</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http: